{"id":"630582","name":"黑芝麻饼","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630582/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"170克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材","img":"images/630582/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑芝麻打碎倒入面粉里面","img":"images/630582/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入酵母、适量清水搅拌成絮状","img":"images/630582/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团","img":"images/630582/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"醒发至两倍大","img":"images/630582/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"葱油、13香、盐、面粉放在一起，拌匀调成一个油酥","img":"images/630582/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面饼擀薄，抹上油酥","img":"images/630582/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"卷起来，分成均匀的剂子","img":"images/630582/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"收口，整理好","img":"images/630582/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一次吃不完，放保鲜盒冷冻","img":"images/630582/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"平底锅烧热，放入芝麻饼","img":"images/630582/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"两面烙至微微发黄，倒入3%1的水","img":"images/630582/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖上锅盖，烧5分钟","img":"images/630582/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"芝麻饼鼓起来就熟了","img":"images/630582/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"两面上色，这样外皮更香","img":"images/630582/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品","img":"images/630582/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}